 "meta": {
  "purpose": "A review queue, and nothing else. These uploads are on the Fondom's YouTube channel and are not in the film record. \"Discovered\" is the whole of what that means: not reviewed, not approved, not public.",
  "discoveredOn": "2026-09-06",
  "source": "The first live run of src/lib/youtube-sync.ts against the channel's uploads playlist. 108 public uploads returned, 46 already in the record, these 62 not.",
  "notPublic": "Nothing reads this file. No page, no search index, no sitemap, no structured data and no Cited Palace AI source imports it, and a test asserts that no module does. Publishing one of these means a person reviewing it and writing it into the canonical record or into video-overrides.json - the same route every other film took.",
  "whyNotClassified": "A video on the channel is not the Fondom asserting something about Guneku's history, and most of these titles say nothing that could support a classification: thirty-six are called '25. March 2024'. Deciding from a title what an occasion was is exactly the mistake the film lifecycle exists to prevent.",
  "uploadYears": {
   "2015": 4,
